      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight text-white">A Foreigner's Guide to Neolithic Chinese Jade</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-warm-200/80">Cong, bi, and what they actually mean — a practical guide for museum visitors.</p>
